1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:12,450
Slide 5 diagrams THE HOTKEY OF POWER: ALT + SPACE. Sarah, James, why is `Alt + Space` the most contested shortcut in computing?

2
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:17,896
Because human muscle memory is the ultimate psychological real estate!

3
00:00:17,896 --> 00:00:25,610
Mac users press `Cmd + Space` for Spotlight, and Windows power users press `Alt + Space` for PowerToys Run.

4
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,630
It is an unconscious reflex!

5
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:38,660
Look at the 3-step kernel execution pipeline on screen: Step 1: When you tap `Alt + Space`, a Win32 Low-Level Keyboard Hook intercepts the raw hardware keycode in 1 millisecond.

6
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:47,770
Step 2: A borderless, transparent WebView2 overlay window pops up at the center of your active monitor in just 18 milliseconds.

7
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:58,010
And Step 3: That floating bar routes your input: text queries go to Gemini Flash in the cloud, file searches query the local index, and screen captures trigger Google Lens!

8
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:06,670
Whoever controls those first 100 milliseconds captures 100% of the user's daily search curiosity and commercial intent!

9
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:12,640
Controlling the input gateway is controlling the cognitive flow of the human architect.

